{
 "_descrizione": "English translations of the catalog fields (data/catalog), by body id: name, wiki (title of the English Wikipedia article) and the texts in phys, magnetic, rings. \"values\" translates whole texts of any body (also those built by the program, like the exoplanets). Missing fields stay in Italian.",
